---
import BotanicalAccent from './BotanicalAccent.astro';
---

<section id="studio" class="studio botanical-zone" aria-labelledby="studio-title" data-botanical-reveal>
	<div class="page-width studio__layout">
		<div class="studio__statement">
			<p class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO</p>
			<h2 id="studio-title">Flowers can say what words cannot.</h2>
			<div class="studio__ornament" aria-hidden="true">
				<span></span>
				<svg viewBox="0 0 44 52" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
					<path class="studio__ornament-stem" pathLength="1" d="M21 49C20 45 20 42 21 38C22 34 22 30 22 26C22 21 23 17 22 13C21 9 22 6 22 3" />
					<g class="studio__ornament-leaf-set" style="--leaf-order: 0">
						<path class="studio__ornament-branch" pathLength="1" d="M21 38C20 37 19 36 18 35" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M18 35C13 34 9 30 7 25C13 25 18 29 20 35C19 35 18 35 18 35Z" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M18 35C14 31 10 28 8 26" />
					</g>
					<g class="studio__ornament-leaf-set" style="--leaf-order: 1">
						<path class="studio__ornament-branch" pathLength="1" d="M22 26C23 25 24 24 25 23" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M25 23C30 19 35 17 39 16C37 22 33 26 26 26C26 25 25 24 25 23Z" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M25 23C30 20 34 18 38 17" />
					</g>
					<g class="studio__ornament-leaf-set" style="--leaf-order: 2">
						<path class="studio__ornament-branch" pathLength="1" d="M22 13C21 13 20 12 19 11" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M19 11C15 10 12 7 11 3C16 4 20 7 21 13C20 12 19 12 19 11Z" />
						<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M19 11C16 8 13 5 12 4" />
					</g>
				</svg>
				<span></span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="studio__copy">
			<p class="studio__lead">Some moments call for a soft, familiar touch. Others deserve a little colour and a lot of joy.</p>
			<p>From the gentle layers of a rose bouquet to the easy brightness of seasonal blooms, each style offers its own way to share a feeling. Explore the shapes, colours, and small details that make flowers so easy to remember.</p>
			<div class="studio__notes" aria-label="The collection’s character">
				<div><span>01</span><p>Colour with character</p></div>
				<div><span>02</span><p>Shape and softness</p></div>
				<div><span>03</span><p>A feeling in every bloom</p></div>
			</div>
			<a class="text-link" href="#collection">Return to the collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<BotanicalAccent side="right" />
</section>
